{
  "name": "Weekly Sunday digest email from Notion",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-main",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -40,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 900,
        "content": "## Sunday digest from your Notion workspace\n\nEvery Sunday morning this workflow reads four Notion databases and emails you one plain-text summary, so you start the week knowing what needs attention.\n\n**Who it's for:** freelancers, consultants and solo founders who run clients, invoices, sales and content in Notion.\n\n### How it works\n1. A schedule trigger runs every Sunday at 09:00 (cron `0 9 * * 0`, workflow timezone Europe/Oslo).\n2. Four Notion nodes fetch overdue invoices, active projects, your sales pipeline and your content plan.\n3. A Code node keeps deals in Contacted, Proposal or Negotiation that haven't been touched for 7+ days, plus content in Draft or Scheduled, and builds the email text.\n4. One email goes to the address you set.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Connect your Notion credential in each of the four Notion nodes, and share the databases with that integration.\n2. Open **Set your settings** and paste your four database IDs and your email address.\n3. Connect an SMTP credential in **Send Sunday digest email** (or swap in the Gmail/Outlook node).\n4. Change the schedule in **Every Sunday at 09:00**, and the timezone under Workflow settings.\n5. Click **Run manually to test**, check your inbox, then activate.\n\n### Customization\n- Property names used: `Name`, `Status`, `Amount`, `Stage`, `Last touched`, `Deal name`, `Title`. Rename them in the Notion filters and the Code node to match your databases.\n- Change `COLD_AFTER_DAYS` to decide when a deal counts as cold.\n- Add or remove sections in the Code node."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-s1",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Section 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 360,
        "height": 520,
        "content": "## 1. Schedule\nRuns every Sunday at 09:00. Use the manual trigger to test."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-s2",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Section 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 280,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 2. Settings\nYour database IDs, email and cold-deal threshold."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-s3",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Section 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1300,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1200,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 3. Read Notion\nFetches invoices, projects, pipeline and content."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-s4",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Section 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2600,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 680,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 4. Build and send\nTurns the results into one email."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "cron",
      "name": "Every Sunday at 09:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        560,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * 0"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "manual",
      "name": "Run manually to test",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "position": [
        560,
        640
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "config-node",
      "name": "Set your settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "notes": "Paste your 4 Notion database IDs and your email address here. Credentials live in n8n Credentials, never in this node.",
      "position": [
        960,
        540
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-1",
              "name": "NOTIFY_EMAIL",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "you@example.com"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-4",
              "name": "FINANCE_DB_ID",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "PASTE_YOUR_FINANCE_DATABASE_ID"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-5",
              "name": "PROJECTS_DB_ID",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "PASTE_YOUR_PROJECTS_DATABASE_ID"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-6",
              "name": "PIPELINE_DB_ID",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "PASTE_YOUR_PIPELINE_DATABASE_ID"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-7",
              "name": "CONTENT_DB_ID",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "PASTE_YOUR_CONTENT_DATABASE_ID"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-8",
              "name": "COLD_AFTER_DAYS",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 7
            }
          ]
        },
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "fin",
      "name": "Get overdue invoices from Notion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "position": [
        1360,
        540
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "key": "Status|select",
              "condition": "equals",
              "selectValue": "Overdue"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": true,
        "databaseId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Set your settings').first().json.FINANCE_DB_ID }}"
        },
        "filterType": "manual"
      },
      "executeOnce": true,
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "id": "proj",
      "name": "Get active projects from Notion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "position": [
        1660,
        540
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "key": "Status|select",
              "condition": "equals",
              "selectValue": "Active"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": true,
        "databaseId": {
          "__rl": true,
